Alpha and Beta travelled to [[Ethiopia]] with [[the Professor]] and [[Rassimov]]. {{Source|The Golden Asp}} He later fought the Huntik team in [[King Solomon's mines]] but was forced to reteat when [[Lok Lambert]] invoked the [[Legendary Titan]] of Spirit, [[Tao]]. {{Source|To Be Together}}

He was later involved in the attack on [[Dante Vale's house]] and fought with the Huntik team. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}} When the Huntik team raided [[the Professor's castle]], he invoked his [[Jokoul]] and [[Strix]] Titans and fought with [[Zhalia Moon]] before being rendered unconscious by her [[Darksleep]] power. {{Source|The Divine Comedy}}

When the Huntik team broke into [[Organization Central]], Alpha fought and was defeated by [[Dante Vale]]. {{Source|Doorway to Huntik}}

When [[Grier]] led the Huntik team to the Professor's Castle, [[Hoffman]] send him and Beta to fight Dante and Grier. After a long battle, he was defeated by Grier. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}

